{"id":"afbe0f23c45d10d5","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-small-sigma-pi.md","title":"Arbitrarily Small Degrees of Both Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Type","display":"thm-degree-small-sigma-pi — Arbitrarily Small Degrees of Both Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Type","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-small-sigma-pi","aliases":["67-thm-degree-small-sigma-pi"],"display":"thm-degree-small-sigma-pi — Arbitrarily Small Degrees of Both Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Type","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","[[67-df-degree-structure]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"Theorem 7.11","source_printed_pages":[105,106],"source_pdf_pages":[116,117],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-small-sigma-pi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-small-sigma-pi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-small-sigma-pi — Arbitrarily Small Degrees of Both Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>105</span><span>106</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>116</span><span>117</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf0_T\">\\(T,D_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf0_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T\">\\(\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是一致的、固定 PR 呈示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 扩张；不额外要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta\\to\\exists b\\in\\mathsf S_T\\cap\\mathsf P_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Tb&lt;_Ta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta\\to\\exists b\\in\\mathsf S_T\\cap\\mathsf P_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Tb&lt;_Ta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷105–106页/PDF116–117页定理11，比单独存在一个非平凡交集度更强。在任意非底度之下都能找到这样的度，两个复杂度代表句可以不同。</p>\n<p>已读原书自指构造：从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 下的不可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句出发，借引理18构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 及其同度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，利用保守性排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证，并控制其度严格低于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。引理18的证明在书中留给读者；本轮未补全，因此仍不作为证明链全部已核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref